{"pageid":2252,"title":"Lab","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Lab</span>","revid":19111,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The Lab is a location in the <a href=\"/wiki/Snowy_peaks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snowy peaks\">Snowy Peaks</a> associated with the <a href=\"/wiki/Lab_Card\" title=\"Lab Card\">Lab Card</a> quest. \n</p><p>The Lab can be accessed from a cave entryway in the Peaks, near the Taiga entrance to the biome. Most of the lab is non-interactible, but the <a href=\"/wiki/Unknown_Person\" title=\"Unknown Person\">Unknown Person</a> can be spoken to through a small grate in the wall, behind the broken glass. Speaking to them gives you the option to begin the quest.\n</p><p>There is an exit to the <a href=\"/wiki/River_Caves\" title=\"River Caves\">River Caves</a> through a nearby vent, however it is nearly impossible to get back up to it from the Caves, so do not use it unless you are certain your business is finished in the Lab. Amusingly, a poster of a kitten with the text \"BELIEVE\" over its head can be found in this area.\n</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0375697d5950656dc72dee5832475d34\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Lab-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:79px; width:185px; top:53px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Lab.png\" title=\"Lab.png (5.2 MB)\" style=\"height:79px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0c/Lab.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20231122012940\" title=\"Lab.png (5.2 MB)\" class=\"thumbima